      ],
      "cues": [
       "You have your own oven. Maybe it is the email you keep rereading.",
       "Maybe it is the form, the call, the corner of the garage.",
       "The pattern is the same: a small bad feeling, then a detour that soothes it.",
       "Researchers still argue about how much is feelings and how much is planning.",
       "But many agree the feeling comes first, and the detour follows."
