   "title": "The Question",
   "goal": "Close on a question",
   "target_s": 25,
   "shots": [
    {
     "sequence": {
      "type": "narration",
      "settings": [
       "rooftop_dusk",
       "kitchen_morning"
      ],
      "mood": "warm",
      "seed": 12,
      "actors": [
       {
        "k": "maya",
        "x": 960
       }
      ],
      "cues": [
       "So here is something to notice, with no pressure at all.",
       "Next time you feel the pull of a detour, name the feeling underneath.",
       "Just name it. Is it boredom, doubt, or fear of looking foolish?",
       "Naming it will not do the work, but it shows you what you are dodging.",
       "So tell me: what did you clean the last time you avoided something?"
      ]
